{
  "_comment": "Cross-validation target is the FAssets indexer's OWN API (flare-foundation/fasset-indexer packages/fasset-indexer-api, a self-hosted NestJS query service), NOT a GraphQL subgraph. There is no public hosted read endpoint documented in the source README, so `subgraph.url` is left as a TODO: run fasset-indexer-core (Flare mainnet) + fasset-indexer-api and point the URL at its REST base. authEnv is null (the self-hosted API is unauthenticated by default). Many API endpoints serve eth_call-derived state (AgentVaultInfo, FTSO prices, dashboard aggregates) that this core-EVM-slice port intentionally does not reproduce.",
  "subgraph": {
    "url": "TODO_FASSET_INDEXER_API_BASE",
